WEBVTT

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:11.400
"Kodomo no Odocha"

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:13.740
That rumor that I love you

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:17.370
is true, yes it is.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:20.870
You can't ignore it either.

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:25.460
Whether you're awake or asleep,

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:29.090
please don't be embarrassed.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.680
Is it a sin if I sneak into your heart

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:40.350
by ridding you...

00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:43.520
...of your other love?

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:48.110
At sunset,

00:00:48.730 --> 00:00:50.610
when the children go home,

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:54.570
Today's incident is burning love!

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:58.450
You can tell it accurately.

00:00:58.740 --> 00:01:00.540
7 O'Clock News!

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:04.330
Please, our relationship...

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:09.960
Please don't blame it on the true kiss

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:11.800
In a city without light,

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:15.680
let's burn the fire of love.

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:19.100
Don't be so easy going

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:21.390
The existence is a mistake

00:01:21.760 --> 00:01:24.890
You're asking for something not there.

00:01:32.030 --> 00:01:35.030
I'm Kurata Sana, a 6th grader
and TV personality.

00:01:35.030 --> 00:01:38.030
Mama, the novelist,
and Maro-chan, the chipmunk.

00:01:38.030 --> 00:01:41.370
My former boyfriend, Rei-kun.
Now, he's a fine manager!

00:01:41.370 --> 00:01:44.370
I'm Babbit. My favorite food
is green tea rice.

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:47.710
Hayama Akito, my natural enemy
and good friend.

00:01:47.710 --> 00:01:52.050
"Moto-dana = ex-husband"

00:01:47.710 --> 00:01:52.050
This man is Mama's ex-husband,
Kashima Ryosuke-san.

00:01:52.050 --> 00:01:55.380
Same old crazy hairstyle
you've got there.

00:01:55.380 --> 00:01:59.050
And you've come here to say
that same old line you always do.

00:01:59.050 --> 00:02:00.720
--"Lend me money!"
--"Lend me money!"

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:03.390
And you're going to give me
the same answer as always.

00:02:03.390 --> 00:02:05.390
--"I don't have any money to lend you!"
--"I don't have any money to lend you!"

00:02:05.390 --> 00:02:07.730
You know that, and yet you
still stroll on back here.

00:02:07.730 --> 00:02:10.770
I bet you've gotten into debt again
with your gambling, haven't you?

00:02:10.770 --> 00:02:12.070
You've got a bad habit of doing that.

00:02:12.070 --> 00:02:14.400
You'll really never get over it,
until the day you die!

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:16.740
What good is getting over it
after you're dead?

00:02:16.740 --> 00:02:20.160
Cut it out. I know well enough
that you're not the kind of woman

00:02:20.160 --> 00:02:21.820
who could do something like--

00:02:25.410 --> 00:02:26.410
He never learns, does he?

00:02:26.410 --> 00:02:29.750
He'll probably go home after taking
five or six shots in the mouth.

00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:34.090
Aah! She shot me 50 or 60 times!

00:02:34.090 --> 00:02:36.090
So, lend me some money?

00:02:36.090 --> 00:02:38.840
Would you learn your lesson!?

00:02:40.430 --> 00:02:41.430
Did I get him?

00:02:41.430 --> 00:02:43.760
Huh? This is Rei-kun.

00:02:43.760 --> 00:02:46.100
Why, you...! Where did you go!?

00:02:46.100 --> 00:02:49.100
Hey, Rei-kun, shake it off! Hey, hey!

00:02:49.100 --> 00:02:51.770
Ah, that gave me a start.

00:02:51.770 --> 00:02:53.770
Uncle, you never learn, do you?

00:02:53.770 --> 00:02:55.780
Well, I really am--

00:02:55.780 --> 00:02:57.110
-- --hard up for money.
--Where did he go!?

00:02:57.110 --> 00:02:58.780
What are you, a magician?

00:02:58.780 --> 00:03:01.410
Oh, yeah, I wanted to give this to you.

00:03:01.410 --> 00:03:02.700
What is it?

00:03:02.700 --> 00:03:05.620
Something quite popular these days--
Gapyon, the lucky bunny.

00:03:05.620 --> 00:03:08.750
Sana-chan, I'm sure
you'll be thrilled by it.

00:03:08.750 --> 00:03:10.750
Do you like it?

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:13.420
Yes, I'm overjoyed!

00:03:13.420 --> 00:03:14.420
Terrific.

00:03:14.420 --> 00:03:17.760
No, it's not terrific,
you empty-talking good-for-nothing!

00:03:17.760 --> 00:03:19.760
Get out of here!

00:03:19.760 --> 00:03:22.720
Goodbye! Thanks for the ugly bunny!

00:03:22.720 --> 00:03:25.220
I'll be back!

00:03:26.760 --> 00:03:29.890
"Give Me Sympathy and Lend Me Money"

00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:33.100
Look! Isn't he cute!?

00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:35.610
Sana-chan, that's Gapyon,
the lucky bunny,

00:03:35.610 --> 00:03:39.110
which was ranked third on
"This Week's Lamest Best Ten" on TV.

00:03:39.110 --> 00:03:40.070
Isn't he cute?

00:03:40.070 --> 00:03:41.450
No, I was just...

00:03:41.450 --> 00:03:42.450
Isn't he cute?

00:03:42.450 --> 00:03:44.740
Will you be content
if I say so, Sana-chan?

00:03:44.740 --> 00:03:47.410
What a super-lame doll.

00:03:47.410 --> 00:03:50.790
Lame? What's so lame about it? How is
it lame? Go ahead and tell me, Hayama!

00:03:50.790 --> 00:03:51.790
His ears are lame.

00:03:51.790 --> 00:03:52.460
Is that all?

00:03:52.460 --> 00:03:53.120
His eyes are lame.

00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:54.130
Ho, ho, what else?

00:03:54.130 --> 00:03:56.420
His name is lame.

00:03:56.420 --> 00:03:59.670
I know, you don't have to say it!
Even so, even so, even so,

00:03:59.670 --> 00:04:03.130
Mama's ex-husband gave it to me!
What can I do!?

00:04:03.130 --> 00:04:06.300
Ex-husband? Ah, I read
about it in that book.

00:04:06.300 --> 00:04:08.810
Sana-chan, your mama was
married once before, huh?

00:04:08.810 --> 00:04:09.810
He means this book.

00:04:09.810 --> 00:04:12.480
Yes, yes, that's right. Her ex-husband.
And the thing of it is...

00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:15.770
Guys, Sana-chan is composing something!

00:04:15.810 --> 00:04:18.820
Click...

00:04:18.820 --> 00:04:23.780
♪ No money, never learns,
won't ever give up. ♪

00:04:24.780 --> 00:04:29.790
♪ I'm out of negatives, but still,
he's a nice guy. ♪

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:35.790
♪ Lame, lame, lame, weak, weak... ♪

00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:39.090
...is how lame my Uncle
who gave this to me is.

00:04:39.090 --> 00:04:42.420
Guys, it looks like
she's done with her song.

00:04:42.420 --> 00:04:45.090
You could always get
rid of that doll, right?

00:04:45.090 --> 00:04:47.090
That would be "looking a
gift squid in the codpiece!"

00:04:47.090 --> 00:04:49.760
This is a squid in a codpiece.

00:04:49.760 --> 00:04:51.770
Knock me ovuh if you can!

00:04:51.770 --> 00:04:54.640
Here goes! Roll! Roll!

00:04:56.100 --> 00:04:58.900
"Child's Toy
Specialty Bowling Tournament"

00:04:57.440 --> 00:04:58.940
Okay, cut!

00:04:59.770 --> 00:05:02.110
It may be woik, but this is hawsh.

00:05:02.110 --> 00:05:04.110
Are you okay, Zenjiro-sensei?

00:05:04.110 --> 00:05:06.110
Man, I'm really beat.

00:05:06.110 --> 00:05:09.450
Okay, you didn't get a strike,
so we're going to do it over.

00:05:09.450 --> 00:05:11.120
Whu--!?

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:16.290
I can't take it! I'd rathuh
be plunged into the abyss!

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:19.130
Zenjiro-sensei! Hang in there!

00:05:19.130 --> 00:05:22.130
It's okay, I'm sure that someday,
an easier, better-paying,

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:31.560
"The Abyss"

00:05:22.130 --> 00:05:24.470
juicier job will come along,
so for now, show your guts and fight!

00:05:24.470 --> 00:05:27.130
Thanks, Sana-chan. You're the only one
that unduhstands me, Sana-chan.

00:05:27.130 --> 00:05:29.470
--There's shua to be a
better job coming alawng...
--Sana-chan, you have a visitor!

00:05:29.470 --> 00:05:30.810
--There's shua to be a
better job coming alawng...
--Okay!

00:05:30.810 --> 00:05:32.060
...definitely coming alawng--

00:05:32.060 --> 00:05:34.730
Have pity on me!

00:05:34.520 --> 00:05:37.270
"Who is the visitor?"

00:05:34.730 --> 00:05:37.400
I wonder who it is. Who could it be?

00:05:37.400 --> 00:05:39.060
Lend me some money?

00:05:39.060 --> 00:05:41.070
Uncle, you're pushing too hard.

00:05:41.070 --> 00:05:43.070
If you don't like me pushing you,
will you lend me some money?

00:05:43.070 --> 00:05:45.740
Mama forbad me to give you any,
so I'm not going to.

00:05:45.740 --> 00:05:48.740
I'm in the middle of work, so bye.

00:05:48.740 --> 00:05:51.280
J- just a minute! The truth of it is--

00:05:53.080 --> 00:05:55.080
You still need something from me?

00:05:55.080 --> 00:05:57.420
Actually, Sana-chan,
I need to talk with you.

00:05:57.420 --> 00:05:59.080
With me?

00:05:59.080 --> 00:06:01.420
So this is the TV studio's cafeteria...

00:06:01.420 --> 00:06:03.750
Say, isn't that Namuro Amie over there!?

00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:08.760
A- and that's Akaja Hamma!
Amazing! This is too much!

00:06:08.760 --> 00:06:12.010
Excuse me, ex-husband,
but you're embarrassing me,

00:06:12.010 --> 00:06:13.430
so could you please
not stare at everyone?

00:06:13.430 --> 00:06:15.770
Aren't you the most
embarrassing one here?

00:06:15.770 --> 00:06:17.770
So, what did you want
to talk to me about?

00:06:17.770 --> 00:06:21.770
Far be it for me to tell you now
that I'm hard up for money...

00:06:21.770 --> 00:06:23.770
Very far be it for you to tell me now.

00:06:23.770 --> 00:06:26.780
I've borrowed a lot of money
from a rather unsavory place...

00:06:26.780 --> 00:06:29.780
Oh, what kind of unsavory place?

00:06:29.780 --> 00:06:32.740
It's this secret
international organization, you see.

00:06:32.740 --> 00:06:35.410
Secret international organization?

00:06:35.410 --> 00:06:36.910
"Oh! This is a serious development!!"

00:06:36.950 --> 00:06:39.870
I guess you could
call it male romanticism.

00:06:39.870 --> 00:06:42.750
Your uncle always
chased after big dreams.

00:06:42.750 --> 00:06:45.760
However, it takes money
to dream in the real world.

00:06:45.760 --> 00:06:47.760
Big dreams, you say?

00:06:47.760 --> 00:06:49.760
Mm-hmm. Up until earlier,

00:06:49.760 --> 00:06:51.510
I traveled throughout
all of Japan's mountains

00:06:51.510 --> 00:06:54.100
looking for the buried treasure
of the Tokugawas!

00:06:54.100 --> 00:06:56.470
And before that, I traveled
to the lakes of the world,

00:06:56.470 --> 00:06:58.770
searching for lake-bound dinosaurs!

00:06:58.770 --> 00:07:02.770
And before that, I probed
into space, looking for UFOs!

00:07:02.770 --> 00:07:05.780
These sorts of things money--
male romanticism, and all.

00:07:05.780 --> 00:07:08.110
You're just a hardcore good-for-nothing.

00:07:08.110 --> 00:07:10.110
Sana-chan!

00:07:10.110 --> 00:07:12.780
Please help your uncle!

00:07:12.780 --> 00:07:14.780
If I don't have the money
by the day after tomorrow,

00:07:14.780 --> 00:07:17.370
the people from the organization
will put your uncle

00:07:17.370 --> 00:07:19.790
into a sumaki and dump me into Tokyo Bay.

00:07:19.790 --> 00:07:21.120
Sumaki?

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:23.460
What's that?

00:07:23.460 --> 00:07:24.460
W- well, a sumaki is--

00:07:24.460 --> 00:07:26.460
Here is your norimaki sushi.
Thank you for waiting.

00:07:26.460 --> 00:07:28.800
Ah, you mean these, do you?

00:07:28.800 --> 00:07:30.800
We didn't order those!

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:32.050
You see, a sumaki is--

00:07:32.050 --> 00:07:34.050
Here are your datemaki omelet rolls.
Thank you for waiting.

00:07:34.050 --> 00:07:36.060
Oh, these, huh?

00:07:36.060 --> 00:07:38.060
We didn't order those, I tell you!

00:07:38.060 --> 00:07:39.730
So you see, a sumaki is--

00:07:39.730 --> 00:07:41.390
Here is your hachimaki headband.
Thank you for waiting.

00:07:41.390 --> 00:07:43.400
You are such a pest!

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:46.070
This is what a sumaki is.

00:07:46.070 --> 00:07:49.400
You see that man over at the counter?

00:07:49.400 --> 00:07:51.700
He's a hit man from
the secret organization,

00:07:51.700 --> 00:07:53.160
here to keep an eye on your uncle.

00:07:54.410 --> 00:07:58.740
He's holding a pistol in the hand
he has inside his breast pocket.

00:07:58.740 --> 00:08:01.540
If I try to run away,
or go to the police,

00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:03.080
he's going to eliminate me on the spot.

00:08:03.080 --> 00:08:04.420
I- it can't be...!

00:08:04.420 --> 00:08:06.420
Sana-chan, you're the
only one I can turn to!

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:10.420
Please lend your uncle a hand,
to save him!

00:08:10.420 --> 00:08:15.430
Don't tell me you want to make money
with my body... to use my body to...

00:08:16.100 --> 00:08:19.770
...make prints with, and then sell them
with my autograph, or something?

00:08:19.770 --> 00:08:21.770
T- that's not what I was thinking.

00:08:21.770 --> 00:08:24.060
You can just think of it as work.

00:08:24.060 --> 00:08:26.110
If you will just come
along with me for one day...

00:08:26.110 --> 00:08:29.110
You mean we can make up
your debt in one day, Uncle?

00:08:29.110 --> 00:08:32.360
It will at least keep
my head attached for now.

00:08:32.400 --> 00:08:35.030
Still, that much will be enough.

00:08:35.030 --> 00:08:37.700
I'd like you to keep this a secret
from Misako and your manager, too.

00:08:37.700 --> 00:08:41.080
Keeping it secret is part of the
promise I made with the organization.

00:08:41.080 --> 00:08:45.040
Please, Sana-chan!
You're the only one I can turn to!

00:08:45.040 --> 00:08:47.710
Are you telling me you
gave me this lame doll...

00:08:47.710 --> 00:08:51.090
...just so that I would do some job
which I don't even know anything about?

00:08:51.090 --> 00:08:55.050
You want to use me, and keep it
a secret from Mama and Rei-kun?

00:08:55.050 --> 00:08:57.680
No, that wasn't my intent.

00:08:59.100 --> 00:09:02.100
That really wasn't your intent, huh?

00:09:02.100 --> 00:09:05.440
Back then... when you gave me this doll,

00:09:05.440 --> 00:09:09.440
the smile on your face looked
very affectionate, Uncle.

00:09:09.440 --> 00:09:11.110
Sana-chan...

00:09:11.110 --> 00:09:14.570
There's no way that somebody
who was trying to trick me,

00:09:14.570 --> 00:09:17.740
or hurt me, would have
such a caring look on their face.

00:09:17.740 --> 00:09:20.410
All right, I'll work for you.

00:09:20.410 --> 00:09:21.790
Sana-chan...

00:09:21.790 --> 00:09:23.790
So what kind of work is it?
Something I can do?

00:09:23.790 --> 00:09:25.620
You can! Sure you can!
If you can do it, you can do it!

00:09:25.620 --> 00:09:26.750
And once you've done it, it'll be done!

00:09:26.750 --> 00:09:31.380
All right! I'll do what
I can for you, ex-husband!

00:09:31.380 --> 00:09:33.460
Hooray!

00:09:38.050 --> 00:09:40.050
Lately "Child's Toy" has been too hawd,

00:09:40.050 --> 00:09:42.060
and I just can't take it!!

00:09:42.060 --> 00:09:43.390
Isn't there easiuh,

00:09:43.390 --> 00:09:45.390
bettuh paying!!

00:09:45.390 --> 00:09:47.390
...woik out there, I wonduh...

00:09:47.390 --> 00:09:52.070
Oh, Zenjiro-sensei! Did you crawl your
way up out of that abyss by yourself?

00:09:52.070 --> 00:09:53.400
Z- Zenjiro-san?

00:09:53.400 --> 00:09:57.070
It's really him!
It's really Zenjiro-san!

00:09:57.070 --> 00:09:59.070
What do you think you're doing!?

00:09:59.070 --> 00:10:00.070
Of course I'm the real thing!

00:10:00.070 --> 00:10:02.410
--This is the real Zenjiro-san, right?
--What othuh TV poisonality would
have teeth sticking out like this,

00:10:02.410 --> 00:10:03.740
--Sure he is. I work with him
--and be wearing
this ridiculous costume!?

00:10:03.740 --> 00:10:05.080
--on "Child's Toy," after all.
--Shua, maybe I'm not getting
any decent woik now, but you watch!

00:10:05.080 --> 00:10:06.410
--I wonder if I can ask Zenjiro-san
--Soon I'll rise up

00:10:06.410 --> 00:10:08.080
--to come work together with us.
--and be one of
Japan's foist-rate comedians!

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:09.750
--I don't know, why don't you ask him?
--Then I'll build a high-falutin' house,
and have a lawts of pretty goils,

00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:11.590
--Um, I'd like to ask you
--and they'll awl be stacked,

00:10:11.590 --> 00:10:14.420
--to do some work for me.
--and not too bright, and-- Huh? Woik!?

00:10:14.420 --> 00:10:17.050
Yes, together with Sana-chan.

00:10:19.430 --> 00:10:21.100
Sana-chan, what kind of woik is this?

00:10:21.100 --> 00:10:22.100
I don't know.

00:10:22.100 --> 00:10:24.770
It's tasty woik, right?
If so, count me in.

00:10:24.770 --> 00:10:26.100
I don't know how tasty it is.

00:10:26.100 --> 00:10:27.770
There you go,
pretending you don't know again.

00:10:27.770 --> 00:10:32.020
It's tasty woik, right? It's tasty woik,
isn't it? I'm shua it must be!

00:10:32.020 --> 00:10:33.690
All right, let's do it.

00:10:33.690 --> 00:10:35.360
R- really?

00:10:35.360 --> 00:10:38.030
I'm not too picky about my woik.

00:10:38.030 --> 00:10:39.360
I should have known, Zenjiro-san!

00:10:39.360 --> 00:10:42.370
Let's do it! Let's see this through!

00:10:44.370 --> 00:10:46.700
I got some tasty woik!

00:10:46.700 --> 00:10:49.330
"You're sure about this, Zenjiro!?"

00:10:46.700 --> 00:10:49.330
I don't know, I don't know...

00:10:49.370 --> 00:10:52.040
Okay, the day after tomorrow, then.

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:53.710
Leave it to us!

00:10:53.710 --> 00:10:54.710
--I'm not sure about this.
--I knew it! It's tasty woik aftuh all.
It's gotta be tasty woik.

00:10:54.710 --> 00:10:56.710
--Sana-chan!!
--I knew it! It's tasty woik aftuh all.
It's gotta be tasty woik.

00:10:56.710 --> 00:10:57.380
--Rei-kun!
--I knew it!

00:10:57.380 --> 00:10:58.970
--You had a visitor?
--It's tasty woik aftuh all.

00:10:58.970 --> 00:11:01.390
--That was terrible, you know--
leaving the studio without telling me!
--It's gotta be tasty woik.

00:11:01.390 --> 00:11:02.720
--so, who was this visitor?
--Awl right, I got some.
I did it, I did it.

00:11:02.720 --> 00:11:04.050
--Well, you see...
--This is gonna be good woik for shua.

00:11:04.050 --> 00:11:08.730
--Him! Sensei's ex-husband!
--This isn't gonna be any dawdgy woik, no.

00:11:08.730 --> 00:11:11.400
--Rei: "Did he come here
to borrow money from you?"
--This is great,

00:11:11.400 --> 00:11:13.730
--Uh, mm-hmm. He came to borrow money.
--I finally found some tasty woik.
This is gonna be easiuh on me.

00:11:13.730 --> 00:11:15.400
--Rei: "You bastard!"
--This is gonna let me
get lawts of pretty goils.

00:11:15.400 --> 00:11:17.360
--It's all right, I turned him down.
--It's gonna be fun.

00:11:17.360 --> 00:11:19.740
--I turned him down flat.
--What could be bettuh than that?

00:11:19.740 --> 00:11:22.070
--Rei: "T- that's good..."
--Things are stawting to look up.

00:11:22.070 --> 00:11:27.080
I'm sorry, Rei-kun. I'm not sure what
it is, but I've taken on other work.

00:11:27.410 --> 00:11:30.750
After all, I just couldn't
leave him there.

00:11:30.750 --> 00:11:35.750
He reminded me somehow of the way you
looked when you were homeless, Rei-kun.

00:11:36.420 --> 00:11:38.420
Sorry, Rei-kun.

00:11:38.420 --> 00:11:39.420
'bout what?

00:11:39.420 --> 00:11:41.090
Nothing, never mind!

00:11:41.090 --> 00:11:43.430
Huh? You're going to work for him?

00:11:43.430 --> 00:11:45.760
Your mama's ex-husband, Sana-chan?

00:11:45.760 --> 00:11:48.100
The guy who gave you that lame doll?

00:11:48.100 --> 00:11:50.770
He's the lucky bunny who
brings happiness, Gapyon, I tell you!

00:11:50.770 --> 00:11:52.770
That guy is dangerous, don't you think?

00:11:52.770 --> 00:11:54.770
What do you mean, he's dangerous?

00:11:54.770 --> 00:11:56.440
Think about it.

00:11:56.440 --> 00:12:00.110
He was thrilled when he gave that doll
as a present to a 6th-grade girl.

00:12:00.110 --> 00:12:02.780
He's sure to be a perverted,
pedophiliac special old fart.

00:12:02.780 --> 00:12:06.120
H- how are you able to
make that assertion, huh!?

00:12:06.120 --> 00:12:08.120
Who are you to be saying
something like that?

00:12:08.120 --> 00:12:10.120
Kissing me against my will...

00:12:10.120 --> 00:12:13.460
And touching my breasts--
although you didn't squeeze...

00:12:13.460 --> 00:12:16.920
You're the super-perveted,
pedophiliac, special, indecent,

00:12:16.920 --> 00:12:18.800
shameless grade-schooler, aren't you!?

00:12:18.800 --> 00:12:22.800
S- Sana-chan and Akito-kun,
you've been doing that...?

00:12:22.800 --> 00:12:25.800
That's amazing. I'm surprised.

00:12:25.800 --> 00:12:28.260
--I've never even held Aya-chan's hand.
--I didn't want him to do those things!
--It's not all that surprising, is it?

00:12:28.260 --> 00:12:29.600
--I get excited just when our eyes meet,
--I didn't want him to do those things!
--It's not all that surprising, is it?

00:12:29.600 --> 00:12:30.560
--but you two have been doing
--But Hayama is such a stupid jerk...
--When you find your opening, you...

00:12:30.560 --> 00:12:32.020
--all kinds of things.
--But Hayama is such a stupid jerk...
--When you find your opening, you...

00:12:32.020 --> 00:12:36.110
Ah, shut up! This isn't
getting us anywhere, you know!

00:12:36.110 --> 00:12:37.440
--That's true.

00:12:37.440 --> 00:12:40.110
Still, are you sure
that job is really okay?

00:12:40.110 --> 00:12:41.440
No problem, no problem.

00:12:41.440 --> 00:12:45.110
Zenjiro-sensei will be with me,
so no big deal, a park in the walk.

00:12:45.110 --> 00:12:46.120
That's "walk in the park."

00:12:46.120 --> 00:12:49.120
You really are worried, aren't you?

00:12:49.120 --> 00:12:52.290
You're worried, which is
why you're telling us this.

00:12:53.460 --> 00:12:56.130
Even if you can trust her ex-husband,

00:12:56.130 --> 00:12:59.040
he might still get rolled up inside
a sumaki by the secret organization,

00:12:59.040 --> 00:13:01.800
together with you.

00:13:01.800 --> 00:13:04.510
I place my hands on my hips
and offer a hearty ha-ha-ha-ha!

00:13:04.510 --> 00:13:06.140
Don't go underestimating Kurata Sana!

00:13:06.140 --> 00:13:10.140
If it comes to that, I'll hit them
with my surefire Komawari kick!

00:13:10.140 --> 00:13:13.810
Anyway, I have an early
start tomorrow, so bye-bye!

00:13:13.810 --> 00:13:17.020
It's worrisome all right, huh?

00:13:19.150 --> 00:13:21.480
Boo on being slapdash!

00:13:21.480 --> 00:13:25.740
"Gekidan Komawari"

00:13:21.480 --> 00:13:24.450
Hi! Gekidan Komawari,
which Sana attends,

00:13:24.450 --> 00:13:25.740
is looking for new members for this term!

00:13:26.160 --> 00:13:27.490
Whether you're serious,

00:13:27.490 --> 00:13:28.490
or whether you're a gagster,

00:13:28.490 --> 00:13:30.950
if you want to improve
your sensibilities, now's your chance!

00:13:30.950 --> 00:13:33.410
Let's together, Gekidan Komawari!

00:13:33.410 --> 00:13:35.540
Don't put on fake commercials!

00:13:36.750 --> 00:13:39.340
Glas-sun, glas-sun, sunglasses.

00:13:47.340 --> 00:13:50.680
Um, if you want Sana-chan,
she's gone out.

00:13:50.680 --> 00:13:51.680
Where?

00:13:51.680 --> 00:13:56.350
Wherever it is, Zenjiro-san came by early
this morning to pick her up in his car.

00:13:56.350 --> 00:13:58.350
Sana-chan, let's get going!

00:13:58.350 --> 00:13:59.690
Right!

00:13:59.690 --> 00:14:01.690
So anyway, I'm going for
a drive with Zenjiro-sensei.

00:14:01.690 --> 00:14:04.360
We're not going to be doing anything I
should feel guilty over, so don't worry!

00:14:04.360 --> 00:14:06.030
--Go!
--Go!

00:14:06.030 --> 00:14:09.070
And you just let her go
without saying anything?

00:14:10.700 --> 00:14:14.910
She's lying to you. She's not the sort of
foolhardy girl who would go on a drive

00:14:14.910 --> 00:14:16.040
with a buck-toothed comedian
on her day off!

00:14:16.040 --> 00:14:20.040
Zenjiro-sensei, we can't say a peep
about today's work to Rei-kun and Mama.

00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:23.300
I know. I haven't said a
peep to my managuh eithuh.

00:14:24.380 --> 00:14:26.050
Hey, thanks for coming.

00:14:26.050 --> 00:14:27.380
S- sure...

00:14:27.380 --> 00:14:30.720
Let me first introduce you to the boss--
I mean, company president.

00:14:30.720 --> 00:14:32.390
Uh, what kind of work is this?

00:14:32.390 --> 00:14:33.760
It's tasty, right?

00:14:33.760 --> 00:14:37.350
Tasty, tasty, and it'll be easy,
well-oining woik, right?

00:14:37.350 --> 00:14:39.690
Hold on, I can't see!
Hey, what's going on here!? Hey!

00:14:39.690 --> 00:14:41.690
Hey! I can't see!

00:14:41.690 --> 00:14:43.270
"What's going to happen to them!?"

00:14:41.690 --> 00:14:43.320
How heart-pounding!

00:14:43.320 --> 00:14:43.940
"President's Office"

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:46.360
Welcome, Kurata Sana.

00:14:46.360 --> 00:14:48.530
I understand that you are
personally going to pay back the money

00:14:48.530 --> 00:14:51.700
that I lent to Ryosuke-kun.

00:14:51.700 --> 00:14:53.740
It doesn't appear
that she has heard, Boss.

00:14:55.370 --> 00:14:59.710
Hey, hey, what do you think you're doing
to this Kyoto, taxi grade-school kid!?

00:14:59.710 --> 00:15:01.710
Did you mean to say "cute" and "sexy"?

00:15:01.710 --> 00:15:04.670
Despite how it looks,
I am a businessman.

00:15:04.670 --> 00:15:07.670
How about I put you to work
at your first task here right away?

00:15:07.710 --> 00:15:09.340
Y- you can't! You promised me!

00:15:09.340 --> 00:15:12.890
What is it you'd have a 6th grader do!?
I'll sue you! I'll curse you!

00:15:12.890 --> 00:15:14.390
I'll even get your grandchildren
back for this!

00:15:14.390 --> 00:15:16.350
I was just kidding about that...

00:15:17.720 --> 00:15:20.060
This is the secret
organization's headquarters?

00:15:20.060 --> 00:15:22.400
Any way you look at it,
this appears to be a church.

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:25.070
All right, let's go rescue Sana-chan!

00:15:25.070 --> 00:15:27.400
Now?

00:15:27.400 --> 00:15:29.360
Those guys are carrying pistols, right?

00:15:29.360 --> 00:15:31.740
And if they catch us,
they'll wrap us up in sumaki.

00:15:31.740 --> 00:15:33.990
Akito-kun, go get us
some bazookas or something.

00:15:33.990 --> 00:15:34.990
Don't have any.

00:15:34.990 --> 00:15:36.660
What do we do?

00:15:36.660 --> 00:15:38.700
Fight, you guys!

00:15:40.330 --> 00:15:43.670
Congratulations, I say, congratulations!

00:15:43.670 --> 00:15:45.960
Yo, yo, groom, I'm so jealous, you dog!

00:15:45.960 --> 00:15:49.010
Where did you latch onto
a beauty of a bride like this?

00:15:49.010 --> 00:15:50.840
And you, the bride, say something here!

00:15:50.840 --> 00:15:52.340
How'd you marry upwards
like this, you femme fatale?

00:15:52.340 --> 00:15:55.010
You're so fortunate
to find such happiness!

00:15:55.010 --> 00:15:58.680
Okay then, what do you say we start
cutting into the wedding cake?

00:15:58.680 --> 00:16:03.350
Hello, I am the wedding cake!
Cut me if you can!

00:16:03.350 --> 00:16:07.690
--Okay then, you two, congratulations!
--Okay then, you two, congratulations!

00:16:07.690 --> 00:16:09.690
Sana-chan...

00:16:09.690 --> 00:16:10.690
That's my idol.

00:16:10.690 --> 00:16:11.700
Boss...

00:16:11.700 --> 00:16:14.700
You never said anything about
making her do all of this, too.

00:16:14.700 --> 00:16:18.700
Do you think you have any right
to say such a thing?

00:16:18.700 --> 00:16:21.370
Of course, my true objective...

00:16:21.370 --> 00:16:23.870
...is tonight's showtime.

00:16:27.380 --> 00:16:29.050
I can't keep up with this.

00:16:29.050 --> 00:16:31.050
We've done 27 events in a row.

00:16:31.050 --> 00:16:33.300
There are 30 more events
before this evening for you.

00:16:33.300 --> 00:16:35.300
--I can't take this!
--I can't take this!

00:16:35.300 --> 00:16:37.300
You seem fine.

00:16:37.300 --> 00:16:39.640
Sana-chan, can I have a minute?

00:16:39.640 --> 00:16:40.970
--I can't take this!
--Yes?

00:16:40.970 --> 00:16:42.940
"A short rest"

00:16:41.310 --> 00:16:42.980
Break time.

00:16:44.310 --> 00:16:48.650
You know, I've been wanting to have
a long talk with you, Sana-chan.

00:16:48.650 --> 00:16:53.320
A... talk... with... me...?

00:16:53.320 --> 00:16:55.660
I don't mean long like that.

00:16:55.660 --> 00:16:58.660
I read the book that Misako wrote.

00:16:58.660 --> 00:17:02.330
I didn't know that Misako felt so troubled
about not being able to have children.

00:17:02.330 --> 00:17:05.000
All else aside,
Mama is still a woman, after all.

00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:07.080
It may sound strange coming from me,

00:17:07.080 --> 00:17:11.340
but I really am glad that you
became Misako's child, Sana-chan.

00:17:11.340 --> 00:17:12.340
Thanks.

00:17:12.340 --> 00:17:13.670
Uncle...

00:17:13.670 --> 00:17:18.010
Sana-chan, what are you doing!?
Our next reception is stawting!

00:17:18.010 --> 00:17:22.020
Okay, see you later!
I've got to go now!

00:17:22.020 --> 00:17:23.020
Sana-chan...

00:17:23.020 --> 00:17:26.690
Her working so hard
is a great help to us.

00:17:26.690 --> 00:17:29.360
The ship can set sail at any time.

00:17:29.360 --> 00:17:31.690
Boss...

00:17:31.690 --> 00:17:32.990
What ship?

00:17:32.990 --> 00:17:37.660
They're planning to
sell Kurata off overseas!

00:17:37.660 --> 00:17:39.320
Sana-chan is going to be sold off!?

00:17:39.320 --> 00:17:41.080
Hey, this is cheap!

00:17:43.000 --> 00:17:46.330
Very well, are you finally
ready to really help us out?

00:17:46.330 --> 00:17:48.670
You've already been working us
hard all day up to now!

00:17:48.670 --> 00:17:52.000
How is this tasty woik!?

00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:54.380
W- would you out it out
with the flashing, awlready?

00:17:56.340 --> 00:17:59.680
Ladies and gentlemen,
thank you for being here tonight.

00:17:59.680 --> 00:18:03.350
Tonight, we offer something that
you don't get to see every day

00:18:03.350 --> 00:18:05.020
in the business we are involved in.

00:18:05.020 --> 00:18:11.940
By special request, we have prepared
some magnificent entertainment for you!

00:18:14.030 --> 00:18:15.030
Ready, Tsuyoshi?

00:18:15.030 --> 00:18:16.030
Mm-hmm.

00:18:16.030 --> 00:18:18.700
Once Kurata comes out, we jump out
and start running around acting wild.

00:18:18.700 --> 00:18:20.370
While we're doing that,
we get Sana-chan.

00:18:20.370 --> 00:18:23.580
I wonder if I really
should have done this.

00:18:23.580 --> 00:18:26.710
No matter how well Sana-chan
can handle it, this is...

00:18:26.710 --> 00:18:29.710
It's showtime!!

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:31.460
"Kurata Sana (and Zenjiro, too)
in a Dojo-sukui Folk Performance Show"

00:18:31.710 --> 00:18:33.300
Loaches!

00:18:33.300 --> 00:18:36.880
--♪ If you're going to scoop up loaches, ♪
--♪ If you're going to scoop up loaches, ♪

00:18:36.880 --> 00:18:39.640
--♪ go scoop where the loaches live! ♪
--♪ go scoop where the loaches live! ♪

00:18:39.640 --> 00:18:41.300
--♪ Isn't that obvious!? ♪
--♪ Isn't that obvious!? ♪

00:18:41.300 --> 00:18:43.310
--♪ You can scoop up loaches, ♪
--♪ You can scoop up loaches, ♪

00:18:43.310 --> 00:18:44.970
--♪ but you can't ♪
--♪ but you can't ♪
--We're going to save them from that?

00:18:44.970 --> 00:18:47.980
--♪ save the world from a crisis! ♪
--♪ save the world from a crisis! ♪
--I- I'm sure they want to be saved.

00:18:47.980 --> 00:18:50.600
--♪ Isn't that obvious!? ♪
--♪ Isn't that obvious!? ♪

00:18:52.310 --> 00:18:53.980
What are you guys up to?

00:18:53.980 --> 00:18:55.820
Hayama Chop!!

00:18:56.990 --> 00:18:58.990
Tsuyoshi Chomp!!

00:18:58.990 --> 00:19:01.490
Hey! That hurts, you bastards!

00:19:03.330 --> 00:19:04.330
Kurata! Now!

00:19:04.330 --> 00:19:06.330
Run away, Sana-chan!

00:19:07.330 --> 00:19:11.670
Stop! My showtime!
The one I worked so hard for!

00:19:11.670 --> 00:19:15.000
What's going on here!?

00:19:15.000 --> 00:19:18.010
How noisy, so late at night!

00:19:18.010 --> 00:19:20.340
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:19:20.340 --> 00:19:24.680
You guys were going to sell
Sana-chan off. Akito-kun said so.

00:19:24.680 --> 00:19:26.350
Ee-yow, Akito-kun!

00:19:26.350 --> 00:19:28.680
This is your fault for
being so ambiguous, sir.

00:19:28.680 --> 00:19:30.690
Yeah, I'm so ashamed!

00:19:30.690 --> 00:19:34.270
No, this plan was my idea.

00:19:34.310 --> 00:19:37.110
Our wedding hall had
fallen on hard times,

00:19:37.110 --> 00:19:38.610
so I thought that if Sana-chan
would come be our host,

00:19:38.610 --> 00:19:43.620
maybe we'd get more customers.
And so I insisted that Ryosuke ask you.

00:19:44.660 --> 00:19:49.620
Ryosuke-kun is not such a
bad person. I guarantee it.

00:19:51.000 --> 00:19:53.290
President, you don't look like
such a bad person yourself.

00:19:53.290 --> 00:19:54.960
Y- you think so?

00:19:54.960 --> 00:19:56.670
Oh? He has a dimple!

00:19:56.670 --> 00:19:59.340
So then, sir, that part about
you being in debt was also a fib.

00:19:59.340 --> 00:20:03.300
No, sure enough, I am in debt
to the president here.

00:20:03.300 --> 00:20:07.970
Still, it was Ryosuke-san's friend's
debt to begin with, wasn't it?

00:20:08.010 --> 00:20:12.310
His friend's business failed, and
Ryosuke-san was the guarantor, that's all.

00:20:12.310 --> 00:20:15.980
But with today's events, we have an
agreement to write that debt off.

00:20:15.980 --> 00:20:16.980
I'm grateful for that.

00:20:16.980 --> 00:20:19.650
Well, that should clear up
any doubts you had.

00:20:19.650 --> 00:20:22.320
But you said it was a secret organization,
so I was sure that...

00:20:22.320 --> 00:20:25.370
He wasn't lying about that part.
Right, Secretary?

00:20:25.370 --> 00:20:26.700
Right, Boss.

00:20:26.700 --> 00:20:27.990
Right, Hit-man?

00:20:28.030 --> 00:20:29.040
Right!

00:20:29.040 --> 00:20:32.620
What!? Then, you guys really
are a secret organization!?

00:20:32.620 --> 00:20:34.290
I should have told you sooner.

00:20:34.290 --> 00:20:36.290
I am the president, Bosuda Bosuo.
("Boss-da Boss-o")

00:20:36.290 --> 00:20:37.630
Hishoyama Piko. (hisho = "secretary")

00:20:37.630 --> 00:20:39.630
Koroshiya Shin'ichi.
(Koroshiya = "hit man")

00:20:39.630 --> 00:20:41.050
--When you need to be secretive,

00:20:41.050 --> 00:20:42.300
--we will lend to you in secret.

00:20:42.300 --> 00:20:44.300
--The Yen Shop, Secret Organization.

00:20:44.300 --> 00:20:45.430
"Please use responsibly..."

00:20:45.470 --> 00:20:47.300
It's your company's name!?

00:20:47.300 --> 00:20:48.640
You played us for fools!

00:20:48.640 --> 00:20:51.310
You're hanging your heads
at a crooked angle!

00:20:51.310 --> 00:20:53.310
"At that moment,
Zenjiro-sensei was..."

00:20:51.980 --> 00:20:53.310
Zen-chan!

00:20:53.310 --> 00:20:56.400
Yum! Yum! This is absolutely delicious!

00:20:56.400 --> 00:20:58.980
Nevuh mind that they're leftovuhs
from a reception, this stuff is rich!

00:20:58.980 --> 00:21:04.490
I'm happy just to be eating anything
this good! This really is tasty woik!

00:21:05.320 --> 00:21:07.910
How is this tasty!?

00:21:09.990 --> 00:21:15.000
This week's Sana-chan!
"Loach, loach, I- I- loach, loach!"

00:21:15.670 --> 00:21:19.000
Mama, I'm sorry I lied
to you and went out.

00:21:19.000 --> 00:21:23.010
But he wasn't a bad person.

00:21:23.010 --> 00:21:28.010
Well, he did tell a lot of fibs,
and tricked me, and all, but still,

00:21:28.350 --> 00:21:31.350
he did say thanks to me.

00:21:31.350 --> 00:21:36.350
I'm sure that he thinks of me as his own,
actual child. I'm sure of it.

00:21:37.350 --> 00:21:40.690
"Ah~ I'm sleepy..."

00:21:37.350 --> 00:21:40.690
Yeah, yeah, I know, I know.
I know, so go to bed already.

00:21:40.690 --> 00:21:43.240
You're wrong!
You don't understand, Mama!

00:21:43.240 --> 00:21:46.030
He still really thinks
a lot of you, Mama--

00:21:46.030 --> 00:21:47.360
Sorry.

00:21:47.360 --> 00:21:50.030
The doll that Uncle gave me...

00:21:50.030 --> 00:21:54.700
On the doll... on the doll...!

00:21:54.700 --> 00:21:56.620
"This is a piggy bank.

00:21:56.620 --> 00:22:00.380
Once it has some money saved up in it,
please return it to me. --Ryosuke"

00:22:00.380 --> 00:22:02.050
You put it in here. Right here.

00:22:02.050 --> 00:22:04.380
What is this!?

00:22:04.380 --> 00:22:06.720
Now you understand
the man's true nature, right?

00:22:06.720 --> 00:22:09.390
Mm-hmm, mm-hmm, I understand!

00:22:09.390 --> 00:22:12.060
It makes me mad just being
reminded about him!

00:22:14.180 --> 00:22:16.430
Is anything saved up?

00:22:17.520 --> 00:22:22.520
Huh? Oh, well. That's okay,
I'll just return it--

00:22:22.860 --> 00:22:24.860
You haven't learned your lesson yet,
and came back again!?

00:22:24.860 --> 00:22:26.860
Like a good-for-nothing
moth to the flame!

00:22:26.860 --> 00:22:28.200
Fire!

00:22:28.200 --> 00:22:29.700
Mother and daughter both!?

00:22:34.040 --> 00:22:35.370
Lend me some money?

00:22:35.370 --> 00:22:37.830
Your tenacity is commendable!

00:22:40.830 --> 00:22:42.340
"Back against the wall."

00:22:42.840 --> 00:22:47.840
That's what you say about times like these.

00:22:49.090 --> 00:22:52.550
In dire straits,

00:22:53.310 --> 00:22:56.140
I've been waiting for an answer.

00:22:56.640 --> 00:23:00.020
My confessions are worked out
long in advance,

00:23:00.980 --> 00:23:05.110
to always go along with the scenario.

00:23:05.320 --> 00:23:11.160
My heart may be settled, but my mind is in a...

00:23:11.410 --> 00:23:13.370
...panic!!

00:23:14.370 --> 00:23:19.210
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:19.410 --> 00:23:21.920
he's there.

00:23:22.830 --> 00:23:25.170
And our usual classroom...

00:23:25.380 --> 00:23:27.760
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:23:27.840 --> 00:23:30.260
...for two.

00:23:31.090 --> 00:23:33.720
Although I've said nothing but wisecracks...

00:23:33.930 --> 00:23:38.480
...up to now, just for today,

00:23:39.390 --> 00:23:42.060
I'm going to be honest and sincere,

00:23:42.270 --> 00:23:46.780
so BOY, take a look my way!

00:23:47.690 --> 00:23:52.360
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:52.530 --> 00:23:55.030
he's there,

00:23:55.990 --> 00:23:58.200
And our usual classroom...

00:23:58.450 --> 00:24:00.790
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:24:00.910 --> 00:24:03.330
...for two.

00:24:07.750 --> 00:24:10.420
Hoy! In Sana-chan's next adventures...

00:24:10.420 --> 00:24:14.390
♪ Aah, living in this world, ♪

00:24:14.390 --> 00:24:17.010
♪ rose in hand... ♪

00:24:17.010 --> 00:24:19.350
What is this, Father Hayama!?

00:24:19.350 --> 00:24:21.690
You don't even talk to your own child
about his mother very often,

00:24:21.690 --> 00:24:24.350
and only worry about your own love-love!
What are you planning!?

00:24:24.350 --> 00:24:28.690
Next time on Kodomo no Omocha,
Episode 28, the "Who is that Beauty
at the Gravesite Visit?" saga,

00:24:28.690 --> 00:24:33.030
Love-Love, Father Hayama's Song

00:24:33.030 --> 00:24:36.200
Father! Phone call from
the neighborhood association!
